      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While lingering fatigue is common after the flu, new heart palpitations and chest tightness—especially during exercise like walking upstairs—are not normal and warrant medical attention. These symptoms could signal lingering inflammation, a post-viral cardiac issue, or another underlying condition that needs evaluation. Please contact a healthcare provider soon to get checked, as they would likely want to listen to your heart and possibly run an EKG to rule out serious complications. Don't ignore these signs; your safety is more important than recovering slowly on your own right now.",
