      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please do not self-diagnose or treat new heart symptoms with supplements like magnesium before seeing a doctor, as this could mask important medical issues like myocarditis or heart failure. Even if cost is a concern, there are many low-cost community clinics or urgent care options that can provide critical tests at affordable rates. Ignoring these warning signs puts your heart at genuine risk, so please try to find a way to get evaluated rather than waiting for them to resolve on their own.",
