      "content": "The hesitation to seek medical help is understandable, but post-viral fatigue typically does not cause new heart palpitations or exertion-induced chest tightness. While rest is important, putting off evaluation for potential heart issues like myocarditis can lead to dangerous complications. Please prioritize your safety and consider a telehealth visit; many providers now offer them remotely, which can save money and protect your privacy.",
